## 📌 Problem Statement

**[PASTE THE EXACT PROBLEM STATEMENT SELECTED IN ROUND 1 HERE]**

Sustainability is an important challenge that requires individuals and communities to understand their environmental impact and adopt responsible practices.

---

## 💡 Solution Overview

**EcoSphere** is a smart sustainability platform designed to help users understand and improve their environmental impact.

The platform transforms everyday environmental activities into measurable sustainability insights and encourages users to make eco-friendly choices.

EcoSphere focuses on helping users:

- 🌱 Understand their environmental impact
- ⚡ Track energy usage
- 💧 Monitor water consumption
- ♻️ Manage and understand waste
- 🌍 Calculate carbon footprint
- 🎯 Build sustainable habits
- 📊 Visualize their sustainability progress

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🌍 Carbon Footprint Tracking
Users can estimate their carbon footprint based on their everyday activities and consumption.

### ⚡ Energy Usage Tracking
Track electricity usage and understand opportunities to reduce energy consumption.

### 💧 Water Usage Tracking
Monitor water consumption and encourage responsible water usage.

### ♻️ Waste Management
Promote proper waste segregation and responsible disposal practices.

### 📊 Sustainability Dashboard
A centralized dashboard displays sustainability-related data and progress through easy-to-understand visualizations.

### 🎯 Eco Challenges
Users can participate in simple daily sustainability activities and build better environmental habits.

### 💡 Smart Recommendations
The platform provides personalized suggestions to help users reduce their environmental impact.

